--Description / Thinking Process:
-- Objective: Among Mountain View-CA providers, determine the 10 specializations with the
--            highest number of distinct NPIs, then return the specialization whose count
--            is closest to the average of those 10 counts.
-- Approach (all inside a single query):
--   • mv          : filter to Mountain View, CA; keep NPI + 15 specialization columns.
--   • spec_counts : UNPIVOT the 15 specialization columns → rows; drop blanks; count
